<section class="px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop py-24 md:py-36 bg-surface">
  <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[260px_1fr] gap-gutter">

    <aside class="hidden lg:block sticky top-32 h-fit">
      <nav class="flex flex-col gap-5 border-l border-outline-variant/30 pl-6 text-label-md uppercase tracking-[0.15em]">
        <a href="#data">Data Collection</a>
        <a href="#sanctuary">Digital Sanctuary</a>
        <a href="#third-party">Third Party</a>
        <a href="#rights">User Rights</a>
      </nav>
    </aside>

    <article>
      <header class="mb-24">
        <span class="block uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-label-md text-secondary mb-8">
          Integrity First
        </span>

        <h1 class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl md:text-[88px] leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.04em] mb-8">
          Privacy as a digital sanctuary.
        </h1>

        <p class="text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-3xl italic">
          We treat personal data as something to protect, not something to extract.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="space-y-24">

        <section id="data" class="scroll-mt-32">
          <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg mb-6">01. The Minimalist Approach</h2>
          <div class="space-y-6 text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-4xl">
            <p>We collect only what is essential to provide a seamless, intentional experience.</p>
            <p>If information does not serve the quality of your experience, we do not ask for it.</p>
          </div>

          <ul class="mt-10 space-y-4 text-on-surface-variant">
            <li>• No third-party advertising cookies.</li>
            <li>• Preference-based data collection only where needed.</li>
            <li>• Minimal analytics intended to improve the product without exploiting attention.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-gutter">
          <div class="bg-surface-container-low p-10 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant">
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md mb-4">Our Promise</h3>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant">
              We will not sell your data to advertisers, brokers, or third parties that monetize your attention.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-primary text-on-primary p-10 rounded-xl">
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md mb-4">Privacy First</h3>
            <p class="opacity-80">
              The Ziyu ecosystem is intended to be funded by products and support, not surveillance.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="sanctuary" class="scroll-mt-32">
          <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg mb-6">02. Digital Sanctuary</h2>
          <p class="text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-4xl">
            Security and privacy are integrated into the product experience from the beginning rather than added as an afterthought.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="third-party" class="scroll-mt-32">
          <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg mb-6">03. Third-Party Services</h2>
          <p class="text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-4xl">
            When outside providers are required for hosting, payments, or infrastructure, we aim to choose partners that respect privacy and security.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="rights" class="scroll-mt-32">
          <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg mb-6">04. User Rights</h2>
          <p class="text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-4xl mb-8">
            You may request access, correction, export, or deletion of your data.
          </p>

          <button class="border border-primary px-8 py-3 rounded-full hover:bg-primary hover:text-on-primary transition-all">
            Request Data Export
          </button>
        </section>

      </div>
    </article>

  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Privacy",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Privacy"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}